Z||000008||007DOUG||06-20-2000||09:33 AM||||Thats the maximum amount. If you were a real goof toward the cop, or go into court with an attitude, you'll probably end up with the maximum.<P>The maximum in my state is something like that too, but most folks get a $250-500 fine. Still steep, but not as steep.<P>You can also make payments. Courts will do that.<P>How long have you had the car? I have State Farm, and they cover any car I buy for 30 days automatically. No new policy needed. Check with your insurance agent.<P>Whatever the outcome, switch the license/insurance TODAY.||||reg||1
